If you have a current modutils installed and it doesn't fix the problem,
the next thing to try is to make sure your toolchain really is
generating correct objects -- which means upgrading binutils.

Also, have you tried the same build with gcc 3.3?  This is still the
default compiler version for sid and sarge.

